**Original (DDICDI)**

`Specification item reference &lt;https://ddi-cdi.github.io/m2t-ng/DDI-CDI_1-1beta/field-level-documentation/DDICDILibrary/Classes/DataDescription/Components/AttributeComponent.html&gt;`__</body>
