              <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Human-understandable name (linguistic signifier, word, phrase, or mnemonic). May follow ISO/IEC 11179-5 naming principles.</body>
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.DescriptorVariable.name"/>
            </ownedComment>
          </ownedAttribute>
