            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Role given to a represented variable that acts as a coordinate axis in a multidimensional structure. Used only in ``cdi:DimensionalDataStructure``. Dimensions are typically categorical (codelist-valued) or quantized continuous variables (e.g., time bins).  The value domain for the represented variable associated with this component defines the dimension space.</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.DimensionComponent"/>
          </ownedComment>
          <generalization xmi:type="uml:Generalization" xmi:id="cdif.DimensionComponent.gen.DataStructureComponent" xmi:uuid="c57e911c-7ab8-591d-95c2-a0f9831583c8">
