            </upperValue>
            <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.ValueAndConceptDescription.cdi_description.comment" xmi:uuid="fb2408a1-e8e7-5454-aa20-2b66b64b233b">
              <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

A description of the value restrictions for this domainin human-readable language. type: string

**Original (DDICDI)**

*Definition:* A formal description of the set of values in human-readable language.

`Specification item reference &lt;https://ddi-cdi.github.io/m2t-ng/DDI-CDI_1-1beta/field-level-documentation/DDICDILibrary/Classes/Representations/ValueAndConceptDescription.html&gt;`__</body>
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.ValueAndConceptDescription.cdi_description"/>
