            <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.ValueAndConceptDescription.cdi_logicalExpression.comment" xmi:uuid="b666f3e6-73f1-5b1d-9f4b-e29089b31c13">
              <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

A logical expression where the values of "x" making the expression true are the members of the set of valid values. For example, "(all reals x such that x &gt; 0)" describes the real numbers greater than 0. type: string

**Original (DDICDI)**

*Definition:* A logical expression where the values of "x" making the expression true are the members of the set of valid values.  For example, "(all reals x such that  x &gt; 0)" describes the real numbers greater than 0.

