            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Identifier or name for the data type concept. A single value wherever it appears — on a variable(``cdi:InstanceVariable``) and on a physical mapping alike. The value may be a plain string (e.g. ``"xsd:decimal"``)or a cdifConceptOrTerm.</body>
