            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Essentially the same as schema:propertyID. Specify the concept that this variable measures or represents. When the dataset's distribution carries cdi:isStructuredBy (CDIF Data Structure profile), cdif:uses references the RepresentedVariable that supplies the represented-variable-level properties below, which are then NOT duplicated on the InstanceVariable. type: string or cdifConceptOrTerm'</body>
