            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

one of: string, ``cdifConceptOrTerm`` ``@id`` reference.

**Original (DDICDI)**

*Definition:* The unit in which the data values are measured (kg, pound, euro), expressed as a value from a controlled system of entries (i.e., QDT). Supports the provision of an identifier for the entry in the authoritative source (a URI, etc.), and the specific vocabulary.

`Specification item reference &lt;https://ddi-cdi.github.io/m2t-ng/DDI-CDI_1-1beta/field-level-documentation/DDICDILibrary/Classes/Conceptual/RepresentedVariable.html&gt;`__</body>
