          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="schema.ContactPoint.comment" xmi:uuid="ebf076f9-814e-5cc7-a256-34c27190b6c6">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Information about how to communicate with a person or organization. CDIF only includes e-mail in its schema.</body>
