      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Package" xmi:id="skos" xmi:uuid="268c4357-d069-5590-ad43-6d48c4f662f2">
        <name>SKOS</name>
        <URI>https://w3id.org/cdif/skos/xmi/</URI>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="skos.Concept" xmi:uuid="f63d5c4c-cf3e-5f29-a87b-c7382dbbffc3">
          <name>Concept</name>
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="skos.Concept.comment" xmi:uuid="019f9f54-7ebb-5066-b09b-c03805773b58">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

SKOS Concept - properties per the guide's second 'Optional Properties' and 'Required Properties' blocks. NOTE: this class has NO heading of its own anywhere in the Codelist guide; its boundary and name were confirmed by the CDIF authors, not extracted from a marker in the source.

**Original (SKOS)**

*Definition:* An idea or notion; a unit of thought.

`Specification item reference &lt;http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept&gt;`__</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="skos.Concept"/>
          </ownedComment>
