              <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

The concept scheme(s) this concept belongs to. Each must be ``{"@id": "scheme-uri"}``.

**Original (SKOS)**

*Definition:* Relates a resource (for example a concept) to a concept scheme in which it is included.

*Scope Note:* A concept may be a member of more than one concept scheme.

`Specification item reference &lt;http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme&gt;`__</body>
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="skos.Concept.inScheme"/>
            </ownedComment>
