            </upperValue>
            <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="skos.Concept.altLabel.comment" xmi:uuid="2841b2d8-7182-5ccc-8d37-23bdd0827465">
              <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Alternative labels.

**Original (SKOS)**

*Definition:* An alternative lexical label for a resource.

*Example:* Acronyms, abbreviations, spelling variants, and irregular plural/singular forms may be included among the alternative labels for a concept. Mis-spelled terms are normally included as hidden labels (see skos:hiddenLabel).

`Specification item reference &lt;http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel&gt;`__</body>
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="skos.Concept.altLabel"/>
            </ownedComment>
          </ownedAttribute>
