              <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

General note.

**Original (SKOS)**

*Definition:* A general note, for any purpose.

*Scope Note:* This property may be used directly, or as a super-property for more specific note types.

`Specification item reference &lt;http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note&gt;`__</body>
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="skos.Concept.note"/>
            </ownedComment>
          </ownedAttribute>
