            </lowerValue>
            <upperValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural" xmi:id="skos.Concept.prefLabel.upper" xmi:uuid="6700faf6-1a23-5c27-8f16-ce682d01c298">
              <value>*</value>
            </upperValue>
            <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="skos.Concept.prefLabel.comment" xmi:uuid="fe8a0ef5-58ac-5ddb-bf67-0d6c415ad449">
              <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Preferred label. At most one per language (enforced by SHACL ``sh:uniqueLang``).

**Original (SKOS)**

*Definition:* The preferred lexical label for a resource, in a given language.

`Specification item reference &lt;http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel&gt;`__</body>
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="skos.Concept.prefLabel"/>
            </ownedComment>
