              <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Narrower (child) concepts. If present, each inline child concept must have ``skos:broader`` pointing back to this concept. Items can be full inline concept objects (for building the JSON tree) or ``{"@id": "child-uri"}`` references.

**Original (SKOS)**

*Definition:* Relates a concept to a concept that is more specific in meaning.

*Scope Note:* By convention, skos:broader is only used to assert an immediate (i.e. direct) hierarchical link between two conceptual resources.

`Specification item reference &lt;http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower&gt;`__</body>
