            <body>**Original (Time)**

Definition
==========

A temporal position described using either a (nominal) value from an ordinal reference system, or a (numeric) value in a temporal coordinate system.

`Specification item reference &lt;https://www.w3.org/TR/owl-time/#time:TimePosition&gt;`__</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="time.TimePosition"/>
          </ownedComment>
