            <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="time.TimePosition.hasTRS.comment" xmi:uuid="75af45ff-58b1-5145-b74a-d236adaa7779">
              <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

identifier for a temporal reference system; default is million years before prsent as a decimal number. Default is http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/OGC/0/ChronometricGeologicTime

**Original (Time)**

*Definition:* The temporal reference system used by a temporal position or extent description.

`Specification item reference &lt;https://www.w3.org/TR/owl-time/#time:hasTRS&gt;`__</body>
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="time.TimePosition.hasTRS"/>
