              <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Number that locates a temporal position in the reference frame defined by the hasTRS property.

**Original (Time)**

*Definition:* The (numeric) value indicating position within a temporal coordinate system

`Specification item reference &lt;https://www.w3.org/TR/owl-time/#time:numericPosition&gt;`__</body>
