    <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Package" xmi:id="CDIFProfiles" xmi:uuid="c1d71e19-21aa-564d-a9d4-2fb5bc9bc2e9">
      <name>CDIFProfiles</name>
      <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="CDIFProfiles.comment" xmi:uuid="47353ff0-cadc-5e66-8cd3-50ec2c4756e6">
        <body>CDIFProfiles (the sibling branch to CDIFUniverse), which holds no classifiers of its own — only Dependency relationships recording which profile uses what). CDIFUniverse is the shared, profile-agnostic pool; CDIFProfiles is the index into it. CDIF Profiles profiles address the most important functions for cross-domain FAIR implementation by providing core metadata fields useful in all domains and infrastructures.</body>
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFProfiles"/>
      </ownedComment>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Package" xmi:id="profiles.Codelist" xmi:uuid="749035a3-e062-553e-b706-c138a638cda4">
        <name>CDIFCodelist</name>
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="profiles.Codelist.comment" xmi:uuid="ba81d0c9-86f2-5948-a259-2a52dfa34d4e">
          <body>CDIF profile: Codelist (IG-derived; from &lt;IG guide: Codelist&gt;)


A CDIF profile for controlled vocabulary codelists implemented as SKOS ConceptSchemes in JSON-LD. Defines how classification schemes, thesauri, and enumerated value domains are represented with machine-enforceable constraints.</body>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="profiles.Codelist"/>
        </ownedComment>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Dependency" xmi:id="profiles.Codelist.dep.common.LanguageTaggedValue" xmi:uuid="97cce549-c83f-568c-ac2a-52aa03ca0621">
          <client xmi:idref="profiles.Codelist"/>
          <supplier xmi:idref="common.LanguageTaggedValue"/>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Dependency" xmi:id="profiles.Codelist.dep.common.ObjectReference" xmi:uuid="b0bc9cb0-bad0-5235-8e07-34afc154330d">
          <client xmi:idref="profiles.Codelist"/>
          <supplier xmi:idref="common.ObjectReference"/>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Dependency" xmi:id="profiles.Codelist.dep.schema.Identifier" xmi:uuid="9a048039-f6f5-514f-8b78-b7f533d4cc97">
          <client xmi:idref="profiles.Codelist"/>
          <supplier xmi:idref="schema.Identifier"/>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Dependency" xmi:id="profiles.Codelist.dep.skos.Concept" xmi:uuid="07d1c210-4864-535a-ac2b-e65c73b1ce62">
          <client xmi:idref="profiles.Codelist"/>
          <supplier xmi:idref="skos.Concept"/>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Dependency" xmi:id="profiles.Codelist.dep.skos.ConceptScheme" xmi:uuid="2276b6d0-86f3-518a-9501-8b51aaa3c5ec">
          <client xmi:idref="profiles.Codelist"/>
          <supplier xmi:idref="skos.ConceptScheme"/>
        </packagedElement>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Package" xmi:id="profiles.ConceptScheme" xmi:uuid="70aa156e-f60d-50e9-9af0-88530e8ff8cb">
        <name>CDIFConceptScheme</name>
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="profiles.ConceptScheme.comment" xmi:uuid="9c553cdb-1def-58ef-b09a-96a5ee062eb9">
          <body>CDIF profile: ConceptScheme (IG-derived; from &lt;IG guide: ConceptScheme&gt;)


Properties for describing concepts of importance to a community. These may provide definitions for use in other CDIF profiles. A typical example would be a community glossary used for the purposes of naming variables. Likely based on SKOS, and possibly on OWL.

Label for this profile still under discussion; suggestions: Concept Systems, Semantics, Concepts, Concept Representation, Concept Description - post to the WG to get a decision.</body>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="profiles.ConceptScheme"/>
        </ownedComment>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Dependency" xmi:id="profiles.ConceptScheme.dep.common.LanguageTaggedValue" xmi:uuid="202b4011-f013-5fff-ad24-3a73cf852a7b">
          <client xmi:idref="profiles.ConceptScheme"/>
          <supplier xmi:idref="common.LanguageTaggedValue"/>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Dependency" xmi:id="profiles.ConceptScheme.dep.common.ObjectReference" xmi:uuid="9951f5cc-8a6d-591c-8c37-3e88118aee78">
          <client xmi:idref="profiles.ConceptScheme"/>
          <supplier xmi:idref="common.ObjectReference"/>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Dependency" xmi:id="profiles.ConceptScheme.dep.schema.Identifier" xmi:uuid="24e1e15c-adea-5472-bff3-1eaa94782ea5">
          <client xmi:idref="profiles.ConceptScheme"/>
          <supplier xmi:idref="schema.Identifier"/>
