      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Package" xmi:id="profiles.Discovery" xmi:uuid="accf87f9-eb0a-5c41-98a9-b0a79762c3d2">
        <name>CDIFDiscovery</name>
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="profiles.Discovery.comment" xmi:uuid="8ea73ab2-446b-5a00-9968-599e146322e4">
          <body>CDIF profile: Discovery (IG-derived; from &lt;IG guide: Discovery&gt;)


The Discovery profile defines properties to document the spatial or temporal extent of the resource content or subject, and to document variables that are specified in a structured dataset. These properties are not included in core based on the observation that the information is not necessarily applicable to any kind of resource.</body>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="profiles.Discovery"/>
        </ownedComment>
